=== FINAL ANSWER ===
The South Park episode featuring time-traveling immigrants is titled "Goobacks." It is the seventh episode of the eighth season and was directed by Trey Parker.

Trey Parker was born on May 19, 1972. His Wikipedia page can be found at: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trey_Parker
